# -*- encoding: utf-8 -*-
# Arc: WarriorPath | Scene: WarriorQueen1

translate pt strings:

    old "A hundred people, that together, represented the leadership of the refugees of Rosanna that had landed in Rahayal."
    new "Cem pessoas que, juntas, representavam a liderança dos refugiados de Rosanna que haviam aterrissado em Rahayal."

    old "A last moment of peace, she thought to herself."
    new "Um último momento de paz, pensou para si mesma."

    old "A divine omen, one that made victory so obvious that it made them eager for the bloodshed."
    new "Um presságio divino, um que tornou a vitória tão evidente que os deixou ávidos pela derramamento de sangue."

    old "A knock at the door startled her."
    new "Um toque na porta a assustou."

    old "A few people in the street seemed to notice them go by, but most went about their day."
    new "Algumas pessoas na rua pareciam notar que eles passavam, mas a maioria continuava com o dia."

    old "A family working at an inn looked up as they passed, sparing them a glance."
    new "Uma família que trabalhava num pousada levantou os olhos ao passar, lançando-lhes um olhar."
